      <title>模型百万token窗口为何让答案越用越差</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260831/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%99%BE%E4%B8%87token%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E8%AE%A9%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88%E8%B6%8A%E7%94%A8%E8%B6%8A%E5%B7%AE/</link>
